# Task Manager - Docker Application

Kompletní, produkční aplikace demonstrující Docker best practices.

## 🎯 Co je zahrnuté

✅ **Frontend** - React s Vite  
✅ **Backend** - Node.js Express API  
✅ **Database** - PostgreSQL s inicializací  
✅ **Cache** - Redis pro performance  
✅ **Monitoring** - Prometheus + Grafana  
✅ **Proxy** - Nginx reverse proxy  
✅ **Orchestrace** - Docker Compose  

## 🚀 Quickstart

```bash
cd app
docker-compose up -d
```

Pak navštiv: **http://localhost:8080**

## 📚 Více info

Viz [README.md](./README.md) v `app/` složce.

---

## 🗂️ Struktura

```
app/
├── backend/        # Node.js API
├── frontend/       # React UI  
├── nginx/          # Proxy server
├── db/             # Database init
├── prometheus/     # Metrics
├── grafana/        # Dashboards
├── docker-compose.yml
└── README.md
```

**Spuštění:** `make start` nebo `docker-compose up -d`  
**Logy:** `make logs`  
**Stop:** `make stop`
